  "title": "Business Bank Accounts 2026: Free Plans, Fees and Changes",
  "meta_description": "Mercury and Brex send domestic wires for $0 on free accounts. Found Plus now costs $35 a month. northone.com redirects to Relay.",
  "lead": "Mercury and Brex send domestic wires for $0 on their free accounts. Relay Starter charges $8. Bluevine, Found and Lili charge $15. Novo charges up to $45. Found Plus now costs $35 a month, up from $19.99 in early 2026. Relay's $30 plan is now Grow and charges $5 per domestic wire. northone.com now redirects to Relay's site.",
